        "code": {
          "text": "Thoracolumbar back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Severe constant pain, 8/10, sudden onset after a long interstate drive 5 days ago and worse over the last 24–48 hours. Midline T11–L1, right greater than left; worse with movement, coughing, and lying flat. Patient describes it as deep in the spine rather than muscular and says it feels different from prior mechanical low back pain."
      }
    },
